{
  "title": "26th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ سَعْيِىْ فِيْهِ مَشْكُوْرًا، وَ ذَنْبِىْ فِيْهِ مَغْفُوْرًا وَ عَمَلِىْ فِيْهِ مَقْبُوْلًا، وَ عَيْبِىْ فِيْهِ مَسْتُوْرًا، يَا اَسْمَعَ السَّامِعِيْنَ.\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'L SA'YEE FEEHE MASHKOORAN WA ZAMBEE FEEHE MAGHFOORAN WA A'MALEE FEEHE MAQBOOLAN WA A'YBEE FEEHE MASTOORAN YAA AS-MA-A'S SAME-E'ENA.\nO Allah, on this day, (please) decide my efforts to be praiseworthy, my sins to be forgiven, my deeds to be accepted, and my defects to be concealed. O most Hearing of all those who can hear!"
}
